# Packing live files

App DB in `database/order-packing-list-generator/`. Run I/O in app folder. Shared joins via `shared/paths.py`.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/Workbook.xlsx` | Process sheets (CL Database sheet archive-only) |
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/New SKU Database.csv` | DTF Des Item-SKU remap |
| `database/order-packing-list-generator/All Orders.csv` | Cumulative run log |
| `database/shared/shipstation/ShipStation_Tags.xlsx` | Tags → process# (shared) |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Enrich |
| `Order Packing List Generator/{Input,Output,Logs,…}` | Run I/O |
| `runtime/SharedInbox/DTF Des/{date}/{shift}/` | DTF Des dual-write |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation credentials |
| `Order Packing List Generator/config/` | gui_config.json |
